    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Illustris</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a human-inhabited galaxy in this action-packed sci-fi Metroidvania.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pilot your starfighter through dozens of fascinating star systems, uncover abandoned ruins, and conquer perilous dungeons filled with secrets and danger. Engage in thrilling space battles against powerful enemies, solve physics-based puzzles with your versatile magnetic beam, and collect mysterious artifacts to unlock new abilities and grow stronger with every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for the ultimate showdown against an overwhelming threat. The fate of all humanity is on the line! Will you be strong enough to stop it?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Illustris</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a human-inhabited galaxy in this action-packed sci-fi Metroidvania.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pilot your starfighter through dozens of fascinating star systems, uncover abandoned ruins, and conquer perilous dungeons filled with secrets and danger. Engage in thrilling space battles against powerful enemies, solve physics-based puzzles with your versatile magnetic beam, and collect mysterious artifacts to unlock new abilities and grow stronger with every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for the ultimate showdown against an overwhelming threat. The fate of all humanity is on the line! Will you be strong enough to stop it?</p>",
